            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak nazywa się zmienna używana do zliczania liczby powtórzeń pętli?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zmienna licznika</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Zmienna śledząca</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zmienna licznika.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest warunek tej pętli <code>while</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co robi <code>counter++</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zwiększa <code>counter</code> o jeden za każdym razem, gdy pętla wykonuje swój blok kodu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tworzy zmienną <code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zwiększa <code>counter</code> o jeden za każdym razem, gdy pętla wykonuje swój blok kodu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score bonus x&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>10</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146775,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" level++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liczby od <code>2</code> do <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby od <code>2</code> do <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
