            "id": 146776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" checkpoint = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (checkpoint &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checkpoint &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + checkpoint);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" checkpoint++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>9</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>11</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>9</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146777,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz zmienną licznika.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyNumber = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyNumber &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyNumber + \" /><text value=\"&quot;. Slime Enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" enemyNumber++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>let</code>, następnie <code>enemyNumber</code>, a potem <code>=</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl liczby od <code>1</code> do <code>5</code>, ustawiając warunek na <code>number &lt; 6</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (number &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + number);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" number++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>number</code>, następnie <code>&lt;</code> i na końcu <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
